@startuml

[*] : Initial state; New Account

New Account --> Registered User : Create Account
Registered User --> Logged In : Login
Logged In --> Ticket Booked : Book Ticket
Ticket Booked --> Payment Confirmed : Confirm Payment
Logged In --> Account Managed : Edit Account Details or Delete Account Details
*:any_state --> Logout : Log Out
Payment Confirmed --> [*] : Logout

@enduml
